    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\">The expectation of log(x) is not the log of the expectation of x.<div>If you compare with the median instead you’ll see that it matches; log(15410) is 9.64.<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">Finn</div></div></div>"
